  "notes": "Desired: a --define-function declaration reaches the whole-binary target list, which otherwise keeps only entries in a section flagged executable. Witness: crackmes.one 5ab77f5433c5d40ad448c1c1 (NEOLite-packed CryptoME.exe), all six sections 0xc0000040 with no MEM_EXECUTE, so decompile-all answered count 0 for the entry `kuna decompile` emitted. Fixture source: pe_datasection_entry_i386.py."
